WEBVTT

00:17:29.796 --> 00:17:31.836
and various other things.

00:17:31.876 --> 00:17:34.396
How do you deal with that,
how do you keep your cool?

00:17:34.436 --> 00:17:35.836
You're quite cool about this.

00:17:35.836 --> 00:17:37.996
AF: Well, calling for your
resignation is mild

00:17:38.036 --> 00:17:40.236
compared to having somebody arrested

00:17:40.276 --> 00:17:41.956
who was trying to kill you.

00:17:42.276 --> 00:17:43.476
So, I mean,

00:17:43.476 --> 00:17:48.156
there's a big spectrum of pushing back
against public health people.

00:17:48.196 --> 00:17:51.236
And that's one of the really
unfortunate things.

00:17:51.276 --> 00:17:55.996
I mean, I keep my cool
because that's just the nature

00:17:56.036 --> 00:17:57.596
of the kind of person that I am.

00:17:57.596 --> 00:18:00.716
When you're dealing with a very,
very difficult situation,